#: ../../../users/contrib.rst:39
msgid ""
"syncthing-macos is a native macOS Syncthing tray application bundle. It "
"hosts and wraps Syncthing, making it behave more like a native macOS "
"application and less like a command-line utility with a web browser "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"syncthing-macos 是原生 macOS 的 Syncthing 系統匣應用程式封裝。它可承載並包裝 "
"Syncthing，使其更像原生 macOS 應用程式，而非需透過網頁瀏覽器操作的命令列工"
"具。"

