#: ../../../users/contrib.rst:44
msgid ""
"Synctrain is an open source, native app for iOS, iPadOS and macOS that "
"combines Syncthing with a file-centered UI with focus on selective and on-"
"demand file synchronization. It can be installed from the `App Store "
"<https://apps.apple.com/app/synctrain/id6553985316>`_."
msgstr ""
"Synctrain 是一款開源的 iOS、iPadOS 與 macOS 原生應用程式，結合 Syncthing 與以"
"檔案為中心的 UI，聚焦於選擇性與隨選同步。可從 `App Store <https://apps.apple."
"com/app/synctrain/id6553985316>`_ 安裝。"

