#: ../../../users/contrib.rst:89
msgid ""
"A cross-platform utility to map Syncthing devices and shared folders. "
"Generates a visual representation of the relationships between several "
"devices and their respective folders, including special folder types (send-"
"only, receive-only).  Requires each device's XML configuration file as input."
