msgid ""
"A small script written in Clojure and Babashka (and thus requires Babashka "
"dependency) that helps to resolve conflicts via emacsclient, vimdiff or "
"other tools. It takes a directory, finds each conflict and let the user "
"decide whether to open the merge program or to skip the file."
msgstr ""
"使用 Clojure 與 Babashka 撰寫的小型腳本（因此需要 Babashka 依賴），可協助透"
"過 emacsclient、vimdiff 或其他工具解決衝突。它會接收一個目錄，找出每個衝突，"
"並讓使用者決定要開啟合併程式或略過該檔案。"

